---
import ServiceLayout from '../../layouts/ServiceLayout.astro';
---

<ServiceLayout
  number="02"
  tag="automation/"
  title="Workflow Automation"
  headline="Kill the busywork. Automate the rest."
  description="End-to-end workflow automation that replaces manual ops and keeps running reliably."
>

  <section class="service-section" aria-labelledby="includes-heading">
    <p class="section-label" id="includes-heading">// What's included</p>
    <ul class="service-deliverables">
      <li>Business process analysis</li>
      <li>n8n / Make workflow design</li>
      <li>Custom Python automation scripts</li>
      <li>API integration (any REST/GraphQL API)</li>
      <li>Error handling + alerting</li>
      <li>Scheduled jobs and triggers</li>
      <li>Handoff documentation + runbook</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="service-section" aria-labelledby="engagement-heading">
    <p class="section-label" id="engagement-heading">// Typical engagement</p>
    <p class="service-engagement">
      Automation projects often start small and grow. I offer both fixed-scope builds and a retainer for ongoing
      automation work. Most initial builds ship within 1–3 weeks.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="service-section" aria-labelledby="tech-heading">
    <p class="section-label" id="tech-heading">// Technologies</p>
    <div class="service-chips">
      <span class="tech-chip">n8n</span>
      <span class="tech-chip">Make (Integromat)</span>
      <span class="tech-chip">Python</span>
      <span class="tech-chip">Node.js</span>
      <span class="tech-chip">REST/GraphQL APIs</span>
      <span class="tech-chip">Webhooks</span>
      <span class="tech-chip">Zapier</span>
      <span class="tech-chip">Airtable</span>
      <span class="tech-chip">Notion</span>
      <span class="tech-chip">Slack</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="service-section" aria-labelledby="usecases-heading">
    <p class="section-label" id="usecases-heading">// Common use cases</p>
    <div class="use-cases-grid">
      <div class="use-case-card">
        <p class="use-case-card__title">CRM + sales pipeline automation</p>
        <p>Auto-enrich leads, trigger follow-up sequences, and sync data across your sales stack.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="use-case-card">
        <p class="use-case-card__title">Invoice and billing automation</p>
        <p>Generate, send, and track invoices automatically — no more manual spreadsheet wrangling.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="use-case-card">
        <p class="use-case-card__title">Data sync between SaaS tools</p>
        <p>Keep Notion, Airtable, Slack, and your CRM in sync without manual copy-paste.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</ServiceLayout>
